      <MissionDesc>Afghans Empowered is a community-based organization that seeks to empower the future generations of Afghans worldwide. We want to connect Afghans around the world with resources available in their local communities, and provide outreach for assistance, as well as representation. We will provide information for non profit and international government platforms for aid and support, for those facing humanitarian crises, as well as support for underrepresented minority populations of Afghan nationals outside the motherland.</MissionDesc>
